title: Demo_Dialogue
position: 308,34
---
This is an example of a Yarn Spinner script. Write your dialogue here!
===
title: loadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase = "">>
<<declare $visitedYet = false>>
<<declare $bunniesLost = 4>>
<<dialoguePhaseSet NPC>> 
<<if $dialoguePhase == "start">>
<<jump Start>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questTaken">>
<<jump quest_taken>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questComplete">>
<<jump quest_complete>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questCompleteReturn">>
<<jump quest_complete_return>>
<<else>>
Farmer: I don't know what to do. This is an error debug message. fix ur shit loser
<<endif>>
===
title: Start
---
<<set $visitedYet to true>>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">> //Syntax for calling a function is: YarnCommand GameObject.name Parameter
Farmer: Hello there! Nice to see you. I hope you're enjoying this adventure!
Farmer: Have you seen any bunnies by any chance? {$bunniesLost} of mine ran out.
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Yes!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        : That's great, did you catch any of them?
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
            ->Yes I found one!
                <<set $bunniesLost to $bunniesLost - 1>>
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
                Farmer: Oh thank goodness! There's now {$bunniesLost} left.
                Farmer: Please come back to me if you find any others. I'd really appreciate the help!
                    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
                    ->Okay I will!
                        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
                        Farmer: Thank you so much!
                        //<<set $agreed_to_help = true>>
                        <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questTaken">> 
                        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
            ->No.
                Farmer: They are quite fast! If you happen to spot one please try to catch it and bring it back!
                    ->Okay I will!
                        <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questTaken">> 
                        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    ->No.
        Farmer: Oh no. Where could they have gone?
        Farmer: Could you help me look? I think they ran outside when their gate broke.
            ->Yes!
                Thank you so much. 
                <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questTaken">> 
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
            ->Sorry, I'm busy.
                <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "repeat">> 
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title:quest_taken
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Good to see you! Did you get the thing I asked?
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Nope.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    ->Yes!
        <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questComplete">> 
        <<jump quest_complete>>
===

title:quest_complete
---
<<if $visitedYet is false>>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Woah, You have what I wanted!
Farmer: I can take that off your hands, thank you!
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->No problem.
        <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questCompleteReturn">> 
        <<set $visitedYet to true>>
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
<<else>>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Oh my goodness you found them? Thank you so much!!
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->You're welcome!
        <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questCompleteReturn">> 
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
<<endif>>
===

title:quest_complete_return
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Thank you so much for finding my bunnies! You're the best.
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Of course!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>

===


title:repeat
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Farmer: Man, I really wish someone would help me find my bunnies...
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->I can help.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        <<dialoguePhaseGetter NPC "questTaken">> 
        Farmer: Really?? Thank you!
        Farmer: Let me know when you find them. There are 4.
    ->That would be nice.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>

===
